.TH bhtune-history-show 1  "bhtune-history-show " 
.SH NAME
bhtune\-history\-show \- Show one run\*(Aqs full detail: config, initial readings, calculated results, and any PID write\-back audit rows
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbhtune\-history\-show\fR [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIRUN_ID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show one run\*(Aqs full detail: config, initial readings, calculated results, and any PID write\-back audit rows
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR [default: table]
How to print the run detail
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
table: Human\-readable text (default)
.IP \(bu 2
json: Pretty\-printed JSON. This is the external contract for scripted/scheduled consumers, so its shape must not change silently once shipped
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIRUN_ID\fR>

